  IDENTIFY_VEHICLE
  CAPTURE_DOCUMENTS
  VERIFY_DOCUMENTS
  CLASSIFY_MATERIAL
  FIRST_WEIGHMENT
  APPROVAL
  UNLOAD
  SECOND_WEIGHMENT
